# NPU_PSUM_PORT supertile matrix.
#
# The two subtiles sit side by side in the north border row, which has no
# configuration bits, so every connection is a plain 1:1 wire.
#
# Sinks are BEL inputs or child INPUT SJUMP wires; sources are BEL outputs
# or child OUTPUT SJUMP wires.

# --- fabric -> BEL: quad wires handed up by the subtiles -----------------
# subtile 0 gives the full write data word
FAB_WDATA0 , NPU_PSUM_PORT0_BASE_TO_TOP0
FAB_WDATA1 , NPU_PSUM_PORT0_BASE_TO_TOP1
FAB_WDATA2 , NPU_PSUM_PORT0_BASE_TO_TOP2
FAB_WDATA3 , NPU_PSUM_PORT0_BASE_TO_TOP3
FAB_WDATA4 , NPU_PSUM_PORT0_BASE_TO_TOP4
